# English logs and errors

All **runtime-facing** strings must be written in **English**:

- `log/slog` messages (`Info`, `Warn`, `Error`, `Debug`)
- `fault` error messages (`New`, `Wrap`, `WithHint`)
- `fmt.Errorf` / `errors.New` wraps returned to callers
- CLI error output (`fault.RenderCLI` labels: operation, cause, hint)
- `t.Skipf` / integration skip reasons when infra is unavailable

Comments, README, and user-facing dashboard UI copy may stay in any language unless explicitly requested.

**Examples**

```go
// Good
log.Info("agent connected", "tunnel_id", id)
return fault.ErrNotFound.New("event not found").WithOp(op)

// Bad
log.Info("агент подключился", "tunnel_id", id)
return fault.ErrNotFound.New("событие не найдено").WithOp(op)
```
